{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"We hear the call.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:20:41.867000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869781384691081236","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"The two wolves begin circling the party.","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:20:52.442000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869781429045850192","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"We are the priestesses of Huginn and Muninn.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:21:08.619000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869781496897097788","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"We are not Huginn and Muninn.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:22:08.556000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869781748291096636","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"The speak with a low but restrained growl.","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:22:33.965000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869781854864179221","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"If there's anything she's good at, it's presentation. She steels herself, stands a little taller, grip tighter on the spear.\n\n\"No. But the twins have fallen. I'm sure you know this.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:23:09.591000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869782004290428968","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"We seek to retrieve them.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:23:18.860000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869782043167453264","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"What is dead is dead. Why do you seek to upturn the order of things. Do you seek what you need?\" Says one.  \"Or do you take what you want?\" Says the other.","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:24:02.168000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869782224814342154","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"We seek what we want, which is that which Kingsbridge needs.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:24:39.206000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869782380163006465","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"And what of our wants. Of our needs?\" The wolves have not come out of kindness, it seems.","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:25:24.149000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869782568667582474","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"“What would… those be?”","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:26:58.860000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869782965914308618","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"What we need. What we want. What we hunger for. The thing that we shall take by the throat and and devour it's heart. To escape as the raven's have.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:29:01.084000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869783478558924900","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"They glare at the party, daring them to say no.","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:29:21.298000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-28T03:29:37.956000Z","id":"869783563342581770","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Open the gate for us to the ravens, and follow us down. The descent is easy.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:29:48.825000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869783678799196220","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Freeing you from your meat sacks is indeed easy. And returning you at the end is also well within our power. But this is not the escape we speak of.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:31:01.520000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869783983704117300","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"“Then speak… plain-ly.”","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:32:09.022000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869784266828050492","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Tether us to this world. The New World. Let us not return under The Half Blind's stupid rule. We tire of his stupid war.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:32:32.937000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869784367134810152","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Apgan raises his eyebrow at this.","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:33:14.361000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869784540879663144","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Do you promise to work with the ravens if we tether you here?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:33:28.278000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869784599251795969","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Willow grips the spear tight.","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:33:51.562000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869784696911982642","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"We promise to speak with the ravens and consider their counsel. It is not unknown to us of the totem you hold, Willow. It was I, Freki who pushed that spear into Yggdrasil after the Allfather impaled himself upon it. I know the vow's strength.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:35:13.948000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869785042463891497","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Then it shall be done.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:35:52.450000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869785203952996383","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"The green man's time has come. Thrust the blade into his eye, and drink of the red sap. Once your souls are free of your stinking bodies we shall take you in our mouths to the place where your path begins.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:37:55.819000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869785721400066048","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
